1
00:00:00,704 --> 00:00:03,704
(Sheldon:)...and you want
to put Gottfried Leibniz on the top.

2
00:00:03,874 --> 00:00:06,294
(Leonard:)Yeah, you got me. I'm a Leibniz man.

3
00:00:06,460 --> 00:00:10,250
(Sheldon:)Perhaps when your mother gets here,
she'll talk some sense into you.

4
00:00:10,422 --> 00:00:13,212
-What? Your mother's coming? When?
-Tomorrow.

5
00:00:13,884 --> 00:00:15,214
When were you gonna tell me?

6
00:00:15,552 --> 00:00:17,382
Oh. Tomorrow?

7
00:00:18,138 --> 00:00:19,968
(Penny:)Why were you keeping this a secret?

8
00:00:20,140 --> 00:00:22,890
(Leonard:)-Well, I just-- I thought--
-If I could interject here.

9
00:00:23,060 --> 00:00:27,270
(Sheldon:)Obviously, Leonard is concerned that his
mother won't approve of you as his mate.

10
00:00:27,439 --> 00:00:31,739
Wh--? Why wouldn't she approve of me?
I'm adorable.

11
00:00:31,902 --> 00:00:35,782
-Yeah, you are. It's just my moth--
-If I could interject again.

12
00:00:35,948 --> 00:00:39,328
(Sheldon:)Leonard comes from a remarkably
high-achieving family...

13
00:00:39,493 --> 00:00:41,783
(Sheldon:)...who have all chosen
high-achieving partners.

14
00:00:41,954 --> 00:00:45,954
(Sheldon:)He probably feels that it's doubtful that
his mother will be overly impressed...

15
00:00:46,124 --> 00:00:49,164
(Sheldon:)...with his dating a woman
whose most significant achievement...

16
00:00:52,422 --> 00:00:54,132
(Penny:)Hey, it's a big menu.

17
00:00:55,676 --> 00:00:57,676
(Penny:)There's two pages just for desserts.

18
00:00:57,844 --> 00:01:01,024
(Leonard:)I know. And those specials,
they change every day.

